 "message": "Here is what company policy says. Sick leave (POL-SICK-01): Full-time employees and interns get 10 paid sick days per calendar year, separate from PTO. Sick days do not carry over. Absences longer than 3 consecutive working days need a doctor's note sent to HR. Contractors are covered by their agency's terms.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
